# path enclosing-function maximum-call-count
# Motor tests use cortexkit_test_support::scratch_root(). Its root derivation
# is in the published dependency, so no motor test needs an exemption.
# Production reads of the OS temp root that have nothing to do with test scratch:
# ck-motor writes a per-connection, create_new 0600 known_hosts pin for the
# Windows runner into the per-user temp directory and removes it on drop.
crates/motor-module/src/transport.rs new 1
